From b886d82db7c3b12a968ab708c791b27bbce9fc35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ekaunt <ekaunt@maany.cloud>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:51:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Click effect shaders: tron_cb_cycles, hex, ring, lock,
 tap

Drawn at the pointer for a moment after a button press. tron_cb_cycles
(the default in zewm): four light cycles shoot out the way the arrow
cursor points, fanned 30 degrees apart. tron_cb_hex: a 4-digit hex code
types out and drops out. tron_cb_ring: a shockwave ring. tron_cb_lock:
corner brackets snap onto the pointer. tron_cb_tap: light cycles leave
the nearest background grid intersection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
